#X obj 720 526 cnv 1 550 488 empty empty A\ SHORT\ HISTORY\ (and\ where\ it\ is\ in\ this\ playground) 8 12 0 13 #f4ecfa #1d3557 0;
#X text 740 556 1907 Lapicque: integrate-and-fire neuron, f 36;
#X text 740 588 1943 McCulloch & Pitts: logical neuron, f 36;
#X text 740 620 1949 Hebb: fire together \, wire together, f 36;
#X text 740 652 1951 Minsky: SNARC learns a maze by reward, f 36;
#X text 740 684 1958 Rosenblatt: the perceptron, f 36;
#X text 740 716 1969 Minsky & Papert: the limits (AI winter), f 36;
#X text 740 748 1982 Hopfield: associative memory, f 36;
#X text 740 780 1983 Barto \, Sutton & Anderson: actor-critic, f 36;
#X text 740 812 1986 Rumelhart \, Hinton & Williams: backpropagation, f 36;
#X text 740 844 1989 Watkins: Q-learning, f 36;
#X text 740 876 1992 Williams: REINFORCE / Tesauro: TD-Gammon, f 36;
#X text 740 908 1995 Beer: CTRNN pattern generators, f 36;
#X text 740 940 1997 Hochreiter & Schmidhuber: LSTM, f 36;
#X text 740 972 2001 Jaeger: echo state networks (reservoirs), f 36;
#X text 1010 556 2003 Izhikevich: simple spiking model, f 36;
#X text 1010 588 2006 Hinton & Salakhutdinov: deep autoencoders, f 36;
#X text 1010 620 2012 AlexNet: the deep learning boom (ReLU), f 36;
#X text 1010 652 2013 Kingma & Welling: VAE, f 36;
#X text 1010 684 2014 Goodfellow: GAN / Bahdanau: attention, f 36;
#X text 1010 716 2015 Sohl-Dickstein: diffusion models, f 36;
#X text 1010 748 2016 AlphaGo: deep RL beats a Go champion, f 36;
#X text 1010 780 2017 Vaswani et al.: the Transformer, f 36;
#X text 1010 812 2020 Ho et al.: DDPM / DiffWave, f 36;
#X text 1010 844 2021 Caillon & Esling: RAVE (realtime audio VAE), f 36;
#X text 1010 876 2022 Olsson et al.: induction heads, f 36;
#X text 1010 908 2022 RLHF: human ratings tune ChatGPT, f 36;
#X text 1010 940 2023 MusicGen \, Stable Audio, f 36;
#X text 1010 972 2024 Nobel: Hopfield & Hinton \, Turing award: Barto & Sutton, f 36;
